$("confirmCasImportBtn").onclick=async()=>{if(!pendingCasImport)return;const p=pendingCasImport;state.investments=state.investments||[];let added=0,updated=0;for(const h of p.holdings){const old=state.investments.find(x=>x.isin===h.isin&&String(x.folio||"")===String(h.folio||""));if(old){Object.assign(old,h);updated++;}else{state.investments.push({id:id(),...h});added++;}}state.investmentImportBatches=state.investmentImportBatches||[];state.investmentImportBatches.push({id:id(),source:"CDSL eCAS",date:p.valuationDate,totalValue:p.totalValue,mutualFundValue:p.mutualFundValue,holdings:p.holdings.length,importedAt:new Date().toISOString()});if(p.valuationDate&&p.totalValue!=null){state.investmentSnapshots=state.investmentSnapshots||[];const exists=state.investmentSnapshots.some(x=>x.date===p.valuationDate&&x.source==="CDSL eCAS");if(!exists)state.investmentSnapshots.push({id:id(),date:p.valuationDate,value:p.totalValue,invested:p.investedTotal||0,source:"CDSL eCAS"});}if(!(await persist()))return;pendingCasImport=null;$("investmentImportDialog").close();toast(`eCAS imported: ${added} new, ${updated} updated MF holdings`);};
$("investmentCsvInput").onchange=async e=>{try{const f=e.target.files[0];if(!f)return;const rs=parseCSV(await f.text());if(rs.length<2)throw Error("No rows found");const h=rs[0].map(x=>x.trim().toLowerCase()),ix=k=>h.indexOf(k);if(["name","type","cost","currentvalue"].some(k=>ix(k)<0))throw Error("CSV columns required: name,type,cost,currentValue; optional: isin,folio,units,valuationDate");state.investments=state.investments||[];let n=0;for(const r of rs.slice(1)){const name=r[ix("name")];if(!name)continue;const isin=ix("isin")>=0?r[ix("isin")]:"",folio=ix("folio")>=0?r[ix("folio")]:"";if(state.investments.some(x=>x.name===name&&x.isin===isin&&x.folio===folio&&isin))continue;state.investments.push({id:id(),name,type:r[ix("type")],isin,folio,units:ix("units")>=0?Number(r[ix("units")])||0:0,cost:Number(r[ix("cost")])||0,currentValue:Number(r[ix("currentvalue")])||0,valuationDate:ix("valuationdate")>=0?r[ix("valuationdate")]:""});n++;}if(!(await persist()))throw Error("Save failed");toast(`Imported ${n} holdings`);}catch(err){toast("CSV import failed: "+err.message);}e.target.value="";};
$("reportCategoryDialog");function openReportCategory(cat){$("categoryDetailFrom").value=$("reportFrom").value;$("categoryDetailTo").value=$("reportTo").value;$("categoryDetailAccount").innerHTML='<option value="">All accounts</option>'+(state.accounts||[]).map(a=>`<option value="${esc(a.id)}">${esc(a.name)}</option>`).join("");$("categoryDetailAccount").value=$("reportAccount").value;const draw=()=>{const f=$("categoryDetailFrom").value,t=$("categoryDetailTo").value,a=$("categoryDetailAccount").value,sort=$("categoryDetailSort").value;let rs=state.transactions.filter(x=>!x.isReminder&&x.kind==="Expense"&&x.category===cat&&(!f||x.date>=f)&&(!t||x.date<=t)&&(!a||String(x.accountId)===String(a)));rs.sort((x,y)=>sort==="oldest"?String(x.date).localeCompare(String(y.date)):sort==="highest"?Number(y.amount)-Number(x.amount):sort==="lowest"?Number(x.amount)-Number(y.amount):String(y.date).localeCompare(String(x.date)));$("reportCategoryTotal").innerHTML=`<span>${rs.length} transactions · Total</span><strong>${money(sum(rs,x=>x.amount))}</strong>`;$("reportCategoryTransactions").innerHTML=rs.length?rs.map(x=>`<div class="list-row"><div class="row-main"><strong>${esc(x.date||"Undated")} · ${esc(x.note||cat)}</strong><small>${esc(x.account||"Unassigned account")}</small></div><div class="row-amount negative">${money(x.amount)}</div></div>`).join(""):empty("No transactions for the selected filters.");};$("reportCategoryTitle").textContent=cat+" · Expenses";["categoryDetailFrom","categoryDetailTo","categoryDetailAccount","categoryDetailSort"].forEach(k=>$(k).onchange=draw);draw();$("reportCategoryDialog").showModal();}
